{"4498860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Survivor", "steam_appid": 4498860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2039.</strong><br>Twenty years after the pandemic that changed the world.<br>A new deadly virus sweeps across the globe, and society collapses overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the earliest witnesses, you are thrown into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With resources running out and information breaking down, <strong>you must make choices</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay at home, or flee with your family?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk your life to help others, or protect yourself?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust people, or survive alone?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your fate.<br>Every choice comes with irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When everything falls apart, will you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by real-world pandemic experiences.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2039.</strong><br>Twenty years after the pandemic that changed the world.<br>A new deadly virus sweeps across the globe, and society collapses overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the earliest witnesses, you are thrown into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With resources running out and information breaking down, <strong>you must make choices</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay at home, or flee with your family?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk your life to help others, or protect yourself?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust people, or survive alone?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your fate.<br>Every choice comes with irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When everything falls apart, will you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by real-world pandemic experiences.</i></p>", "short_description": "The Last Survivor is a serious, narrative-driven visual novel set in a sudden zombie apocalypse. You play as an ordinary high school student forced to make difficult decisions as the world collapses. Every choice matters, and mistakes carry irreversible consequences.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498860/6e3503a8fcd54eb1f7170bf3b321c73caa3fd761/header.jpg?t=1775201825", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498860/9be7cbe879ab9844be29da2d0ad91aa68592398f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775201825", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498860/9be7cbe879ab9844be29da2d0ad91aa68592398f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775201825", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4100 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with Vulkan 1.0 support(e.g. Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Rec